{
  "pluginKey": "tencent-docs",
  "name": "腾讯在线文档",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "minApiSdkVersion": "1.0.0",
  "description": "使用专用账号授权的官方文档服务，独立读取在线文档及精确编辑Word原文、Excel区域，写后回读核验。",
  "author": "KT",
  "entry": "src/index.ts",
  "permissions": ["runtime.http", "plugin.config.read"],
  "runtime": {
    "workerType": "thread",
    "timeoutMs": 115000,
    "memoryMb": 128,
    "maxConcurrency": 1,
    "configKeys": ["TENCENT_DOCS_TOKEN"]
  },
  "configSchema": { "type": "object", "properties": {} },
  "operations": [
    {
      "key": "tencent.docs.read",
      "name": "腾讯文档读取",
      "handlerName": "readDocument",
      "description": "使用官方API读取：/腾讯文档读取 {\"url\":\"https://docs.qq.com/doc/链接ID\"}。正文用offset/limit分页；Word可传findText取得精确匹配位置；Excel先读工作表，再传sheetId/startRow/endRow/startCol/endCol读取矩形（零基，结束不包含，最多2000格）。snapshot供精确编辑使用，不能把一页当全文。",
      "aliases": ["腾讯文档读取"],
      "permissions": ["runtime.http", "plugin.config.read"],
      "timeoutMs": 110000,
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "raw": { "type": "string", "description": "命令后的JSON对象" }
        },
        "required": ["raw"],
        "x-agent-read-only": true
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "tencent.docs.edit",
      "name": "腾讯文档编辑",
      "handlerName": "editDocument",
      "description": "先读取再改指定目标：/腾讯文档编辑 {\"url\":\"链接\",\"expectedSnapshot\":\"读取返回的snapshot\",\"oldText\":\"明确原文\",\"text\":\"新文\"}；原文多处时用findText返回的begin选定一处。Word只改单段普通文字，带版本约束；Excel传同一sheetId和矩形及尺寸一致的values二维数组。回读验证成功才确认完成。",
      "aliases": ["腾讯文档编辑"],
      "permissions": ["runtime.http", "plugin.config.read"],
      "timeoutMs": 110000,
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "raw": { "type": "string", "description": "命令后的JSON对象" }
        },
        "required": ["raw"],
        "x-agent-read-only": false
      }
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "assets": [],
  "migrations": []
}
